---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f2ff3a" />
    <meta name="description" content="Huldex makes useful things available where people live, through shared inventories and smart neighborhood hubs." />
    <title>Huldex™ — Access more. Own less.</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="nav">
      <a class="wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="Huldex home">HULDEX<span>™</span></a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="mailto:hello@huldex.com">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">A shared layer for everyday things</p>
        <h1>Access more.<br /><span>Own less.</span></h1>
        <div class="hero-bottom">
          <p class="intro">Huldex makes useful things available where people live—through shared inventories and smart neighborhood hubs.</p>
          <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@huldex.com?subject=Huldex%20early%20access">Join early access <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="orb" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orb-core"></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="statement" aria-labelledby="statement-title">
        <p class="section-number">01 / THE IDEA</p>
        <h2 id="statement-title">The things you need.<br />Not the things you need to own.</h2>
        <div class="statement-copy">
          <p>Most household objects sit unused. Huldex turns local surplus into reliable access: borrow a drill, pick up a projector, return a carpet cleaner—right around the corner.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="steps" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
        <div class="steps-head">
          <p class="section-number">02 / HOW IT WORKS</p>
          <h2 id="steps-title">Simple by design.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol>
          <li><span class="step-no">01</span><h3>Find</h3><p>See what’s available nearby.</p></li>
          <li><span class="step-no">02</span><h3>Unlock</h3><p>Reserve and collect on your schedule.</p></li>
          <li><span class="step-no">03</span><h3>Return</h3><p>Bring it back for the next person.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="closing">
        <p class="section-number">03 / COMING SOON</p>
        <h2>A lighter way<br />to have enough.</h2>
        <a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:hello@huldex.com?subject=Huldex%20partnership">Build a hub with us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a class="wordmark" href="#top">HULDEX<span>™</span></a>
      <p>Berlin · 2026</p>
      <p>Access is the new ownership.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
